            "title": "Johnson Outdoors (JOUT) Earnings Transcript",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Sales in our third fiscal quarter ending June 2025 increased 5% to $180.7 million compared to $172.5 million in the prior year third quarter.  Operating profit was up significantly to $7.3 million versus an operating loss in the previous third quarter.  While the marketplace continued to fluctuate, our positive results this quarter reinforce the critical importance of our focus and investment in market-leading innovation to continued growth and success of our brands.",
